# Expected mcp_tool_selected/3 facts for ShardType = /coder.
# This is an EXACT set: a missing line and an extra line both fail.
#
# Score derivation (policy_mcp.mg section 50):
#   fs/read_file  skeleton (filesystem + read)            -> /full
